WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.948
You have a blue sweater, a purple sweater,
and a purple skirt.

00:00:03.948 --> 00:00:05.477
Two customers have sent orders.

00:00:05.887 --> 00:00:09.317
Listen for the garment and the color before
handing anything over.

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:11.803
一条紫色的裙子。
One purple skirt.

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:14.598
Pause to choose. Which word names the
garment?

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:17.187
裙子。
Skirt.

00:00:17.597 --> 00:00:19.171
Skirt. Now check its color.

00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:20.860
紫色。
Purple.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:24.018
Purple. Both the skirt and one sweater are
purple.

00:00:24.018 --> 00:00:25.850
Only the skirt fits both clues.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.817
一条紫色的裙子。
One purple skirt.

00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:30.187
一件蓝色的毛衣。
One blue sweater.

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:33.470
Which item fits? First narrow the choices
to sweaters.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.067
Then listen to the color.

00:00:35.476 --> 00:00:36.283
蓝色。
Blue.

00:00:37.213 --> 00:00:41.065
Give the first customer the purple skirt
and the second one the blue sweater.

00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:43.217
The purple sweater was a good decoy.

00:00:43.217 --> 00:00:46.452
It matched a color in one order and a
garment in the other.

00:00:47.382 --> 00:00:50.393
Suppose someone just asks for a sweater.
Two items fit.

00:00:50.393 --> 00:00:51.597
Which question would help?

00:00:52.007 --> 00:00:53.437
Ask which color they want.

00:00:53.437 --> 00:00:56.584
One extra detail can turn a guess into a
clear order.
